# Seven dwarves for the centroid crew. 2026-11-11.
# Names are new. They are not the Soul Pen cast and not the editor pets Vale, Nia, Sol, Kit, Bram, Wynn.
# A row is a seat. The first verb is the one that seat runs. Building and farming stay the verbs the house already has:
# crew_op CLAIM/PLACE for a JOB row, and a plant row when farming is turned on. This file does not place them on the page.
# The spoke named here is the Concept Bank file. Weights live there, not on this row.
# DWARF | id | job | first verb | spoke
DWARF | pick | mine | claim | seat_pick
DWARF | quarry | haul | haul | seat_quarry
DWARF | malt | farm | plant | seat_malt
DWARF | kiln | build | place | seat_kiln
DWARF | loom | cook | cook | seat_loom
DWARF | wick | smith | craft | seat_wick
DWARF | helm | guard | watch | seat_helm
